<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-24T23:34:15.903Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:34:15 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Bandits abducted an 11-month-old baby, killed two clerics and attacked a community in Zamfara, while militia groups targeted Irigwe villages in southern Kaduna and gathered around Kainji Lake. The Nigerian army ambushed bandits, killing two and recovering weapons, and troops killed two terrorists and arrested informants linked to a bandit kingpin in Zamfara. A 19-year-old Christian farmer in Nigeria lost a hand in an attack, and a land dispute in Niger state resulted in dozens of deaths. The conflict recorded 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxQdWROUTNBSzJWQjVESElrOHFrSzBQSW9rbWg1NkdGemtCdGFiYXVJdG9WUWx2Y0xEaXpCTE5qc0VBaURwcEdzd0huZEV4cUdtNjU4Y0ZGLTBpcHcwYTJYcW1hVHRlOFU4SmE1ZU9WUG5xZ3lTSWVObE1PQkI1Z3JDZHRLdmpZZ3lLYmpXdkdGWDlKd0pKQXVsbmlBYWg?oc=5&quot;&gt;International Christian Concern&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxPQU9RVHhRamFXQVBSb0Z0emVuTmhORXVieHRSX0Z1cmszT3MzdTUxeVBPUHBUbnZqUFl5cnBKeEdGcWItcUM5dHZqV0tweHpJNmdRVkd2QWJnR29WNEtyRW9Qb25VMFRPSzA3VERBRnE3all0MTEwT0tqUGZleGZLUHZNdDNLWloyWUFKX1ZLanl0d3FDVXZFeTdvWE4tal9RVHc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Post Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxPMllyR2FPMUlld0daRUlBWkFlZVJCTDY2MlVHMG15NFVxdl9qR1RFcGotMmVPM2hBRU1iVUpzRnJveE1JcWlFQzRYclFodU44S0pEWnh6dldtY1lTTlhwa1Fyd1NfYm9aQjV6NTBsMUJmLWZhblVJdzFOUmtYbkUwWjBOYkF5NElFRnVaMzBaVUJGNEtUcGVNM3J1RkQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Head Topics&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxNdXZSTEZRZmc3VWlrTmtIVndSM2J3aDhhYVprd0FTSTBZN3RCMEc2ckdhXzBTZXJjVWEyRnMxQ19hYVZwMURsYnY2ZDd0QWZpQTczS2lwbGZoM1NaTWltWEE0VjkwaU83NmI2cHhBbXhMLS02Zy1oTjd1ak5YUVpXUkRscFhPSmJDQ2JRNDJFVjJreExZMjRTWXl4SkFpbjdJ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Head Topics&lt;/a&gt;